### 新增课程
POST http://localhost:8085/api/course
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseCode": "CS103",
  "courseName": "软件工程",
  "className": "计科1班",
  "teacherId": 2,
  "classroomName": "第一教学楼-202",
  "layoutRows": 8,
  "layoutCols": 10,
  "weekday": 2,
  "startWeek": 1,
  "endWeek": 16
}

### 查询全部课程
GET http://localhost:8085/api/course
Accept: application/json

### 提交请假申请（请将时间改为未来时间）
POST http://localhost:8085/api/leave/apply
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 3,
  "courseId": 1,
  "startTime": "2027-01-10T08:00:00",
  "endTime": "2027-01-10T10:00:00",
  "reason": "参加比赛"
}

### 审批请假申请
POST http://localhost:8085/api/leave/approve/1?approved=true&remark=同意
Accept: application/json

### 查询待审批申请
GET http://localhost:8085/api/leave/status/PENDING
Accept: application/json
